abstract: >
  Code and derived workflow products for HybridQC, a transparency-first
  preprocessing workflow for heterogeneous annual groundwater records,
  including strict consecutive-year anomaly construction, level–year
  quality control, audit artifacts, range metadata, and cache-stable
  downstream reuse.
